\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces VBFC System Architecture. The interposer sits transparently between the PCH (SPI master) and the original BIOS flash. The RP2040 arbitrates all SPI transactions, routing reads to either the original flash or the authenticated extension flash based on the shadow map, while applying hot-patches from a cached patch table. A passive sniffer logs all transactions for forensic verification. Provisioning occurs via USB-C using the \texttt  {vbfc-host} toolchain.}}{7}{figure.caption.31}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:system_architecture}{{1}{7}{VBFC System Architecture. The interposer sits transparently between the PCH (SPI master) and the original BIOS flash. The RP2040 arbitrates all SPI transactions, routing reads to either the original flash or the authenticated extension flash based on the shadow map, while applying hot-patches from a cached patch table. A passive sniffer logs all transactions for forensic verification. Provisioning occurs via USB-C using the \texttt {vbfc-host} toolchain}{figure.caption.31}{}}
\newlabel{fig:system_architecture@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][6][]7}{}{}{}}
